# pi-orchestrator — Orchestrate v2 operational summary

## Pipeline (▮ = user gate)
    intake → refine ▮ → /workstream new → research → plan → [critique]
      → plan approval ▮ → implement → verify-run → review → report
      → [rework ▮] → /workstream done ▮

## Workstream commands (user-invoked, Orchestrate mode only)
    /workstream new <slug>             # scaffold ~/.pi/agent/orchestrator-workstreams/<slug>/
                                       # prompts planning strategy (1 default · 2 swaps plan/critique tuples)
    /workstream done [slug] [--force]  # print manifest → confirm → guarded cleanup
                                       # refuses dirty/unpushed worktrees unless --force
                                       # merged-branch deletion asked after manifest review

## Artifacts (ADR 0008)
    research/plan/plan-critique dispatches get save_artifact (worker picks
    filename+content only); files land in artifacts/<seq>-<step>-<title-slug>/
    seq at spawn · exclusive-create · manifest indexed at settle · no edits in
    place (revision = new dispatch) · workers list paths under ## Artifacts
    plan = MASTER plan: units + ordering/deps + invalidation notes;
    implement is dispatched per unit, brief cites the plan artifact path

## Step → model tuple (strategy 1: strong-plans + cheap-critique)
    orchestrator   {gpt-5.6-luna, max}
    research       {gpt-5.6-luna, max}
    plan           {claude-opus-5, xhigh}        # strategy 2: swap with critique
    plan-critique  {gpt-5.6-luna, max}
    implement      {gpt-5.6-luna, max}
    verify-run     {gpt-5.6-luna, max}
    review         {claude-fable-5, xhigh}  fallback → {claude-opus-5, xhigh}
                   downgrade_allowed → {gpt-5.6-luna, max}   (trivial diffs, explicit)
    diagnose       {gpt-5.6-luna, max}

Rules: effort never inherited across a model swap · fallback = unavailable
only (exhausted → ask) · downgrade = explicit choice, always surfaced.

## Profiles (Role → Profile → Template)
    implementor:tdd        implementor:diagnose
    reviewer:standards     reviewer:security      reviewer:performance
    planner                plan-critique          (researcher perms + save_artifact)
    researcher (cannot diagnose when experiments/tests are needed)

## Template mandates
    reviews: Conventional Comments · commits: Conventional Commits
    rework: fix the CLASS, report class+count · review: classes not instances
    verify-only: run checks, change nothing, report
    implementor: tests+lint pass before report
    report format: ## Result / ## Changes / ## Concerns / ## Questions

## Reminders
    dispatch pane shows resolved model+effort and saved artifacts; ⚠ flags
    any routing deviation · repo map (~/.pi/agent/repos.json) is advisory —
    unregistered repo: use a worktree and ask · after plan approval: /compact
    (one-line nudge, never automatic)
